          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzomare imisi indwi ushikana impfizi y’impene ku musi nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha; kandi uze wame ushikana n’impfizi y’inka y’umukangara hamwe n’impfizi y’intama, vyompi bitagira agasembwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzomare imisi indwi utanga impongano y’igicaniro, uceze; uko ni ko uzokigira icera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y’iyo misi indwi, kuva ku musi ugira umunani kubandanya, abaherezi bazobe ari bo bashikana ibimazi vyanyu vyo guturirwa, hamwe n’ivy’amashimwe, babizane ku gicaniro. Nanje nzoheza ndavyakire, ni jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
